    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64329" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωβ-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>despitefully treated, outraged</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωβητὸν ἔθηκε </span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλωβήσατο</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.531
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				366
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνης ὁρῶν λωβητὸν εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1069
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωβητὸν αὐτὸν ἐκβαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1388
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθῳ λωβᾱτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1102
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>insulting, abusive</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρὰ καὶ λ. ἔπη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				607
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωβητὸν ἐμπόλημα</span>
			<i>baneful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				538
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				21
			</span></i> (v.l.).</div>
